{{!
    Green box on the AI setup screen after the trial was activated: a short confirmation and a button
    that opens the wizard.

    Rendered by aiinstructions.js into the setup result area.

    @template bookingextension_agent/setup_ready

    @package    bookingextension_agent
    @copyright  2026 Wunderbyte GmbH <info@wunderbyte.at>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading - Bold first words of the confirmation.
    * body - The rest of the confirmation text.
    * openlabel - Label of the button that opens the wizard.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Ready.",
        "body": "AI is now active for this course.",
        "openlabel": "Open the wizard"
    }
}}
<div class="alert alert-success mb-0">
    <i class="fa fa-check-circle mr-2" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>{{heading}}</strong> {{body}}<div class="mt-2">
        <button type="button" id="booking-ai-open-agent-btn" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">{{openlabel}}</button>
    </div>
</div>
